ent-MCActionXenoPsychicLink = Psychic Link
    .desc = Link to a hive sister within 7 tiles to take half her brute and burn damage. Use again to unlink.

ent-MCActionXenoDrain = Drain
    .desc = Hold a living human to draw blood and restore your health and reserves. Feeding on a corpse restores health and carapace instead.

ent-MCActionXenoTransfusion = Transfusion (20)
    .desc = Spend 20 blood to heal a nearby hive sister for 30% of her maximum health. Excess healing grants temporary health.

ent-MCActionXenoCarnage = Carnage
    .desc = Gain speed for up to 10 seconds. Your next slash against a living human heals you. When low on blood, you also knock the victim down and feed.

ent-MCActionXenoFeast = Feast
    .desc = With at least 200 blood, spend 20 per second to heal yourself and nearby hive sisters. Activate again to stop.

ent-MCActionXenoDevour = Devour
    .desc = Swallow a human corpse that can no longer be revived. Target yourself to release it.

ent-MCActionXenoRejuvenate = Rejuvenate
    .desc = Spend 20 blood to thicken your carapace. You move slowly, resist heavy damage, and spend another 20 blood every two seconds to heal. Activate again to stop.

ent-MCActionXenoOppose = Oppose (80)
    .desc = Strike the ground to heal nearby hive sisters, stagger adjacent enemies and injure enemies on your tile.

ent-MCActionXenoPsydrainFree = Psy drain
    .desc = { ent-MCActionXenoPsydrain.desc }
